s","credits":2,"creditsMax":12,"description":"Field experience providing supports and services to students with or at risk for disabilities. 2 to 12 undergraduate hours. 2 to 12 graduate hours. Approved for S/U grading only. May be repeated for up to a total of 18 hours, 12 of which may be taken in the same term. 2 to 12 undergraduate hours. 2 to 12 graduate hours. Approved for S/U grading only. May be repeated in the same term for up to 12 hours, to a maximum of 18 hours in separate terms.","prereqCodes":[],"prereqText":"Satisfactory completion of all requirements of the Council on Teacher Education Transition Points leading to initial licensure. (http://www.cote.uiuc.edu).","prereqNote":"","genEd":[],"sameAs":[],"noise":false,"url":"https://catalog.illinois.edu/courses-of-instruction/edpr/"},{"code":"EDPR 432","subject":"EDPR","number":"432","level":400,"title":"Ed Prac in EC & ELED","credits":2,"creditsMax":12,"description":"Course in practice teaching to meet licensure requirements for teaching in the elementary school. 2 to 12 undergraduate hours. 2 to 12 graduate hours. Approved for S/U grading only.","prereqCodes":["CI 420","CI 406"],"prereqText":"CI 420 or CI 406 as required by the student's curriculum; Satisfactory completion of all requirements of the Council on Teacher Education Undergraduate or Graduate Common Assessment Plan for Initial Certification (http://cote.illinois.edu/).","prereqNote":"","genEd":[],"sameAs":[],"noise":false,"url":"https://catalog.illinois.edu/courses-of-instruction/edpr/"},{"code":"EDPR 433","subject":"EDPR","number":"433","level":400,"title":"Internship in Early Childhood Education","credits":12,"creditsMax":12,"description":"Focuses on a teaching internship in early childhood teacher education, including planning, instructing and assessing students in schools or early childhood centers. Designed for students that are not pursuing the Illinois Professional Educator License. 12 undergraduate hours. No graduate credit. Approved f